  <p>Chinese-language secondary coverage (e.g. IT之家 on the same day) restates the same framing: inference as the “middle layer” between trained weights and affordable serving, NVIDIA + Ascend compatibility, and the recipe companion. Prefer the GitHub README and the X thread when those diverge.</p>

