  <h2>What we are not claiming</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We are not DeepSeek; this is a third-party installer note for dshbase readers.</li>
    <li>We are not publishing MIPS, $/tok, or tok/s tables without a primary source number we can point at in prose (the README charts exist; we leave their pixels in the repo).</li>
    <li>We are not telling you to replace the official API with a half-built private stack.</li>
  </ul>

